Z||000000||Carrolles||01-25-2000||10:03 PM||||I know what a few of the abbreviations mean but how about someone listing what they all mean.<P>Thanks,<P>Carroll||||reg||1
Z||000002||fierosound||01-25-2000||11:07 PM||||A few abbreviations below:::<P><BR>AFAIK As Far As I Know <P>AFK Away From Keyboard <P>ANSI American National Standards Institute <P>ASCII American Standard Code for Information Interchange <P>ATM At The Moment (or Asynchronous Transfer Mode, or possibly Automatic Teller Machine). <P>BFD Big F**king Deal <P>BFN Bye For Now <P>BBS Bulletin Board Systems <P>BIOYA Blow It Out Your A** <P>BOHICA Bend Over, Here It Comes Again <P>BRB Be Right Back <P>BTDTGTS Been There, Done That, Got the T-Shirt <P>BTSOOM Beats The S**t Out Of Me <P>BTW By The Way <P>CLI Command Line Interface <P>CFV Call For Voting <P>CRAFT Can't Remember A F**king Thing <P>CUA Commonly Used Acronym(s) OR Common User Access <P>CUL8R   See You Later<P>DARFC Ducking And Running For Cover <P>DETLA Double Extended Three Letter Abbreviation <P>DH Dear Husband (also Dear Hubby, Duh Hubby and of course Dick Head) <P>DIY Do It Yourself <P>EAK Eating At Keyboard <P>ESAD Eat S**t and Die <P>ESADMF Eat S**t and Die Mother F**ker <P>ETLA Extended Three Letter Abbreviation (ie more than three letters) <P>FAQ Frequently Asked Questions <P>FIIK F**ked If I Know <P>FLA Four/Five Letter Abbreviation (ETLA and DETLA are preferred since they are self-referential.) <P>FOAD F**k Off And Die <P>FOD FOD <P>FOFL Falling On Floor Laughing <P>FULSP F**k You Little S****y Pervert <P>FTP File Transfer Protocol <P>FTF Face-To-Face (as IRL) <P>FU F**ked Up <P>FUBAR F**ked Up Beyond All Recognition <P>FUD (spreading) Fear, Uncertainty, and Disinformation <P>FWIW For What it's Worth <P>FYI For Your Information <P>GAL Get A Life <P>GG Gota Go <P>GR&D Grinning, Running, & Ducking (alternatively GD&R) <P>GUI Graphical User Interface <P>HAGD Have A Great Day <P>HAND Have A Nice Day <P>HTH Hope This Helps <P>HTML HyperText Markup Language <P>HTTP HyperText Transfer Protocol <P>IAE In Any Event <P>IANAL I Am Not A Lawyer (also IANAxxx, such as IANACPA) <P>ICBW I Could Be Wrong (sometimes It Could Be Worse) <P>IIRC If I Recall Correctly <P>IMAO In My Arrogrant Opinion <P>IMHO In My Humble Opinion <P>IMNSHO In My Not So Humble Opinion <P>IMO In My Opinion <P>IOW In Other Words <P>IRL In Real Life <P>ISDN It Still Does Nothing <P>ISWYM I See What You Mean <P>ISTR I Seem To Recall <P>L8R Later<P>LART Luser Attitude Readjustment Tool <P>LMAO Laughing My Ass Off <P>LOL Laughing Out Loud <P>MHBFY My Heart Bleeds For You <P>MHOTY My Hat's Off To You <P>MUD Multi-User Domain/Dungeon <P>NFW No F**king Way <P>NRN No Reply Necessary <P>NYCTMI Now You Come To Mention It <P>ob Obligatory <P>OIC Oh, I See! <P>OOI Out Of Interest <P>OOTB Out Of The Box (brand new) <P>OTOH On The Other Hand <P>OTTH On The Third Hand <P>PCMCIA People Can't Memorize Computer Industry Acronyms <P>PDA Public Display of Affection <P>PITA Pain In The Arse <P>PDQ Pretty D**m(ed) Quick(ly) <P>PMFJI Pardon Me For Jumping In <P>PKB Pot, Kettle Black (as in "Look at the pot calling the kettle black.") <P>FAQ Frequently Asked Questions (and Answers.) <P>ROFL Rolling on the Floor Laughing <P>ROLF Basically ROFL, but laugh and floor are switched, meaning an unfunny, offensive, corny, stupid joke. <P>ROTFL Rolling On The Floor Laughing <P>ROTFLMAO Rolling On the Floor, Laughing My A** Off <P>RFC Request For Comment <P>RSN Real Soon Now (can be meant sarcastically) <P>RTFM Read The F**king Manual <P>RTFFAQ Read The F**king FAQ <P>RYFIM Read Your F**king Information Manual <P>SFAIAA So Far As I Am Aware <P>SCNR Sorry, Could Not Resist <P>SITD Still In The Dark <P>SNAFU Situation Normal, All F**ked Up <P>TANSTAAFL There Ain't No Such Thing As A Free Lunch <P>TIA Thanks In Advance <P>TIC Tongue In Cheek <P>TLA Three-Letter Acronym (such as this, see also ETLA and DETLA) <P>TRSZ The Red Salamander Zaruga (Hey, he offered me chocolate :-) .) <P>TTFN Ta ta For Now <P>TTYL Talk To You Later <P>TWIMC To Whom It May Concern <P>TYVM Thank You Very Much <P>UCE Unsolicited Commerical E-mail <P>URL Universal Resource Locator (sometimes called Uniform Resource Locator) <P>WTH What The Hell <P>WTF What The F**k <P>WWW World-Wide Web <P>WYMM Will You Marry Me? (Currently restricted to alt.fan.pratchett AFAIK.) <P>WYSIAYG What You See Is All You Get <P>WYSIWYG What You See Is What You Get <P>YABSA Yet Another Bl**dy Stupid Acronym <P>YHBT You Have Been Trolled <P>YKYHBxTLW You Know You Have Been x Too Long When (eg, YKYHBPDTLW - You Know You Have Been Playing Doom Too Long When...) <P>YMMV Your Mileage May Vary <P><BR>For more abbreviations and emoticons (smileys  ;-) etc.)  got to this site:<BR> <A HREF="http://kidspenpals.about.com/kids/kidspenpals/msubacro.htm?iam=ask&terms=where+emoticons+list%3F" TARGET=_blank>http://kidspenpals.about.com/kids/kidspenpals/msubacro.htm?iam=ask&terms=where +emoticons+list%3F</A> <P><BR><p>[This message has been edited by fierosound (edited 01-26-2000).]||||reg||10
Z||000003||Monkeyman||01-26-2000||04:53 AM||||WOW!  The only other one I can think of is:  ROFLMMFAO--Rolling On Floor Laughing My Mother F****** A** Off  (sorry about the language!)||||reg||1
Z||000004||Monkeyman||01-26-2000||07:44 PM||||Or how about...TIRFIAWSOWBIGTJPCITIUTITF.  The translation, of course, is:  That Is Really Funny In A Weird Sort Of Way, But I Got The Joke.  Pretty Cool.  I Think I'll Use That In The Future.<P>And maybe you have forgotten this one:  PSSUBTTMFFLSOBF.  In case anyone has forgotten the translation, here it is:  Please Send Small, Untraceable Bills To The Monkeyman Foundation For Lost, Stolen Or Beatup Fieros.||||reg||1
